iv class="card"><div class="label">Pending approvals</div><div class="metric" id="approvals">—</div></div><div class="card"><div class="label">Queued jobs</div><div class="metric" id="jobs">—</div></div><div class="card"><div class="label">Degraded connectors</div><div class="metric" id="connectors">—</div></div></section><section class="cols"><div class="panel"><h2>Add website</h2><form id="addSite"><p><input name="name" required placeholder="Website name"> <input name="domain" required placeholder="example.com"> <button type="submit">Register</button></p></form><h2>Website portfolio</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Domain</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody id="siteRows"></tbody></table></div><div class="panel" id="automation"><h2>Automation activity</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Job</th><th>Status</th><th>Attempts</th></tr></thead><tbody id="jobRows"></tbody></table></div></section><section class="panel" id="features" style="margin-top:16px"><h2>Feature Control</h2><p><select id="featureSite"><option value="">Select website</option></select></p><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>State</th><th>Entitlements</th><th>Rollout</th></tr></thead><tbody id="featureRows"></tbody></table></section><section class="panel" id="priority" style="margin-top:16px"><h2>Growth Priority Center</h2><div id="prioritySummary" class="sub">Loading recommendation portfolio…</div></section><section class="panel" id="approvals" style="margin-top:16px"><h2>Approval Inbox</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Recommendation</th><th>Class</th><th>Decision</th></tr></thead><tbody id="approvalRows"></tbody></table></section><section class="cols"><div class="panel" id="connectors"><h2>Connector Governance</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Connector</th><th>Status</th><th>Last error</th></tr></thead><tbody id="connectorRows"></tbody></table></div><div class="panel" id="audit"><h2>Audit History</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Action</th><th>Object</th><th>Time</th></tr></thead><tbody id="auditRows"></tbody></table></div></section><section class="panel" id="readiness" style="margin-top:16px"><h2>Production Readiness</h2><div id="readinessStatus" class="sub">Checking deployment prerequisites…</div></section><section class="panel" id="security" style="margin-top:16px"><h2>Production Security</h2><div id="securityStatus" class="sub">Checking production posture…</div></section><section class="panel" id="health" style="margin-top:16px"><h2>Website Health</h2><p><select id="healthSite"><option value="">Select website</option></select> <button id="runScan">Run Full Scan</button></p><div class="metrics"><div class="metric"><span>Overall</span><strong id="scoreOverall">—</strong></div><div class="metric"><span>SEO</span><strong id="scoreSeo">—</strong></div><div class="metric"><span>QA</span><strong id="scoreQa">—</strong></div><div class="metric"><span>Pages</span><strong id="scorePages">—</strong></div></div><div id="severitySummary" class="sub" style="margin-top:12px">Priority: —</div><div id="scanProgress" style="margin-top:12px"></div></section><section class="panel" id="competitors" style="margin-top:16px"><h2>Competitor & Package Intelligence</h2><p class="sub">Verified evidence only. GrowthOS will not invent competitor features or pricing.</p><div id="competitorWorkspace">Select a website in Website Health to inspect competitor intelligence.</div></section><section class="panel" id="portfolioCommercial" style="margin-top:16px"><h2>Portfolio Commercial Intelligence</h2><p class="sub">Website-level revenue, cost, net value and ROI. Currency groups remain separate.</p><div id="portfolioCommercialRows">Loading portfolio commercial results…</div></section><section class="panel" id="commercialPriorities" style="margin-top:16px"><h2>Evidence-Gated Commercial Priorities</h2><p class="sub">Ranks only verified changes whose recorded commercial events have complete evidence. This is an analytical ordering, not proof of causation.</p><div id="commercialPriorityRows">Loading supported commercial priorities…</div></section><section class="panel" id="commercialQuality" style="margin-top:16px"><h2>Commercial Evidence Quality</h2><p class="sub">Separates supported, incomplete and unavailable commercial evidence.</p><div id="commercialQualityRows">Loading evidence quality…</div></section><section class="panel" id="commercialPortfolio" style="margin-top:16px"><h2>Portfolio Commercial Intelligence</h2><p class="sub">Website-level revenue, recorded cost, net value and ROI. Currency groups remain separate.</p><div id="commercialPortfolioRows">Loading portfolio commercial results…</div></section><section class="panel" id="roi" style="margin-top:16px"><h2>Commercial ROI</h2><p class="sub">Evidence-backed revenue, cost, net value and ROI for verified GrowthOS changes. Currency groups remain separate.</p><div id="roiRows">Loading ROI intelligence…</div></section><section class="panel" id="revenue" style="margin-top:16px"><h2>Revenue Attribution</h2><p class="sub">Evidence-backed revenue linked to verified GrowthOS changes. Currencies are kept separate.</p><div id="revenueRows">Loading attributed revenue…</div></section><section class="panel" id="impact" style="margin-top:16px"><h2>Measured Impact</h2><p class="sub">Evidence-backed baseline vs after-change outcomes for verified executions.</p><div id="metricGoalControls"><h3>Metric Goals</h3><p><select id="goalSite"><option value="">Select website</option></select> <input id="goalMetric" placeholder="metric key"> <select id="goalDirection"><option value="increase">Increase is better</option><option value="decrease">Decrease is better</option></select> <input id="goalUnit" placeholder="unit"> <input id="goalTarget" type="number" step="any" placeholder="target (optional)"> <button id="saveMetricGoal" type="button">Save goal</button></p><div id="metricGoalRows" class="sub">Select a website to manage metric goals.</div></div><div id="impactRows">Loading measured outcomes…</div></section><section class="panel" id="intelligence" style="margin-top:16px"><h2>Growth Intelligence</h2><p class="sub">QA · SEO · Competitors · Growth</p><p>Evidence-producing engines use the durable job system and feed governed recommendations into the Approval Inbox. External scans remain fail-closed until their connectors are configured.</p></section></main></div><script>window.GrowthOS='.wp_json_encode(['rest'=>$rest,'nonce'=>$nonce,'version'=>GROWTHOS_VERSION]).';</script><script src="'.esc_url($base.'assets/growthos.js').'"></script></body></html>';
 exit;
